\[Alpha],p1init,p2init,\[Gamma]:\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(10\), \(-3\)]\),\
\[CapitalLambda]:\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(10\), \(2\)]\)] calculates the \
average MLE estimators for n trials\>\""}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
